     mmaaxx4444000099 — driver for MAX44009 Ambient Light Sensor

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     To compile this driver into the kernel, place the following lines in your
     kernel configuration file:

           ddeevviiccee mmaaxx4444000099
           ddeevviiccee iiiiccbbuuss

     Alternatively, to load the driver as a module at boot time, place the
     following line in loader.conf(5):

           max44009_load="YES"

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The mmaaxx4444000099 driver reports illuminance data from MAX44009 Ambient Light
     Sensor.

     The mmaaxx4444000099 driver reports data via sysctl(8) entry in the device's node
     in the sysctl(8) tree:

     _i_l_l_u_m_i_n_a_n_c_e  The illuminance, in lux units.

     On an FDT(4) based system the following properties must be set:

     _c_o_m_p_a_t_i_b_l_e  Must be set to "maxim,max44009".

     _r_e_g         The I2C address of mmaaxx4444000099 which can be either 0x4a or 0x4b.

